{"root":{"data":{"id":"dbwl1jeyzgw0","created":1754609175339,"text":"上下文不忠实性"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dbwl1nh2gk00","created":1754609184173,"text":"内在幻觉"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dbwl28vvvg80","created":1754609230782,"text":"Semantic Frame Errors（语义框架错误）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dbwl29mh9k00","created":1754609232390,"text":"Predicate Error (PredE)谓词错误","note":"动词表达错误，比如原文里是“批准”，但是输出是“拒绝”"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dbwl2hvhubc0","created":1754609250349,"text":"Entity Error\n(EntE)主体错误","note":"输出的事件主体出错了，比如原文说的是新冠，结果输出出来成埃博拉了"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dbwl2jvcsuw0","created":1754609254694,"text":"Circumstance\nError (CircE)情景错误"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dbwl2fqm5y00","created":1754609245701,"text":"Discourse Errors（篇章错误）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dbwl2le95w00","created":1754609258014,"text":"Factual Extrinsic Error（事实型外在幻觉）","note":"输入里没提到，但是输出里“自动补充”"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dbwl2mcibvk0","created":1754609260085,"text":" Non-Factual Extrinsic Error（虚假型外在幻觉）"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dbwl2571aug0","created":1754609222749,"text":"外在幻觉"},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}